457 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (The challenge this year is to launch a rocket carrying two raw eggs to a height of 750 feet and return them safely to the ground within 36 to 39 seconds, without cracking the eggs. It really is rocket science! As we aspire to make it to National Finals and be among the best teams in the country, we will be learning lifelong skills in teamwork, perseverance, and STEM. )
/E (The challenge this year is to launch a rocket carrying two raw eggs to a height of 750 feet and return them safely to the ground within 36 to 39 seconds, without cracking the eggs. It really is rocket science! As we aspire to make it to National Finals and be among the best teams in the country, we will be learning lifelong skills in teamwork, perseverance, and STEM. )
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [3 4]
>>
